This is because when chunking a request, we don't tell the `httplib` / `http.client` library to skip the host header if one is already set. From the [`adapters.HTTPAdapter.send()` implementation](https://github.com/requests/requests/blob/9a8a826f226e6973d72914b4a4fc806e0b5036f4/requests/adapters.py#L456-L458):

```python
