                                        url,
                                        skip_accept_encoding=True)
```

which leaves the [`skip_host` parameter](https://docs.python.org/3/library/http.client.html#http.client.HTTPConnection.putrequest) set to `False`. It probably should use `skip_host='host' in request.headers` here.

